  "Note: “The roads are devastated by recent earthquakes, sometimes they end and start again from {0} meters away to the left or right side. You don’t have to backtrack here or any other location, this world goes on forever and you will encounter the same camp multiple times, so don’t worry about leaving them behind if you are not equipped enough to deal with them. Chose one direction north, south, east, or west at the start and follow it roughly, this way you don’t end up going in circles. Always keep the engine filled with oil and radiator with water, good luck.”": "紙條：「最近的地震把道路摧毀得亂七八糟，有時路會突然中斷，再從左側或右側 {0} 公尺外重新出現。你不必折返這裡或任何其他地方，這個世界無邊無際，同樣的營地你會遇上很多次，所以裝備還不夠應付時，別擔心把它們拋在身後。一開始就從北、南、東、西選定一個方向，大致沿著走，這樣就不會一直繞圈子。引擎裡的機油和水箱裡的水要隨時加滿。祝你好運。」",
