  "Permanent base mode disables far away item deletion (optimization), therefore making it possible to settle down and store items, cars in one place, use this option with map cheat, press \"Home\" button to mark home base on the map.\n\nWARNING: This can cause massive performance issues late game, due to far away items not being deleted. Use at own risk.": "永久基地模式會關閉遠處物品的刪除（效能最佳化），讓你可以定居下來，把物品和車輛存放在同一處。請搭配地圖作弊使用，按「Home」鍵在地圖上標記基地。\n\n警告：由於遠處物品不會被刪除，遊戲後期可能造成嚴重的效能問題。使用風險自負。",
  "Permanent base mode disables far away item deletion (optimization), therefore making it possible to settle down and store items, cars in one place, use this option with map cheat, press \"Home\" button to mark home base on the map.\n\nWARNING: This can cause massive performance issues, crashes late game, due to far away items not being deleted. Use at own risk.": "永久基地模式會關閉遠處物品的刪除（效能最佳化），讓你可以定居下來，把物品和車輛存放在同一處。請搭配地圖作弊使用，按「Home」鍵在地圖上標記基地。\n\n警告：由於遠處物品不會被刪除，遊戲後期可能造成嚴重的效能問題甚至當機。使用風險自負。",
